# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Enquiry form delivery (optional)
#
# The contact form works with no configuration: if none of the variables below
# are set, /api/enquiry returns ready-made mailto and WhatsApp links and the
# form hands the composed enquiry to the visitor's own mail app. No lead is
# lost, nothing is stored in a database.
#
# To have enquiries delivered to your inbox automatically, set BOTH of:
#   ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL  a verified sender on your domain, e.g. "Neural IT <enquiries@neuralitlimited.online>"
#   RESEND_API_KEY      an API key from resend.com
#
# Or forward them anywhere as JSON by setting:
#   ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL e.g. a Zapier / Make / n8n catch hook
#
# ENQUIRY_TO_EMAIL is optional and defaults to the address in lib/site-config.ts.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ENQUIRY_FROM_EMAIL="Neural IT <enquiries@neuralitlimited.online>"
# RESEND_API_KEY=
# ENQUIRY_WEBHOOK_URL=
# ENQUIRY_TO_EMAIL=
